      "before": "Projected (honored) keys: `build.target`, `build.rustflags`,",
      "after": "**CRA-1 prospective static registry index-key compatibility.** The exact CONTRACT.md and selection.json under docs/implementation/m3/snapshot-plan-c/native-registry-alias-r1/ honor only registries.<name>.index as the actual admitted configuration-definition/current-workspace static original index association, using pinned Cargo RegistryName/GlobalContext URL/source/manifest-branch semantics. All other registries keys and the registry table remain stripped/disclosed; no credential/provider/protocol/default/fetch/cache/executable/environment authority. This conditional exception refines the registries stripping below without widening other CC1–CC5/rustflags obligations. Existing projection schema/digests/bounds/key sequences/raw lock/pkg1/CSJ/NSK/NIJ/DS4/counter/provenance rules remain. Complete configuration precedence/relative URL interpretation/deterministic bytes and accounting, sealed source gates, input/parser/activation/custody/namespaces/failures/producer/library/product admission remain unpublished or unimplemented and required before use. Four synthetic Cargo controls and exact schema/source copies establish key relevance only; no native profile/admission/R3/effectiveL/owner/qualification completion.\n\nProjected (honored) keys: `build.target`, `build.rustflags`,"
    }
